  "summary": {
    "tr": "Derbent Çiftliközü Beldesi merkezindeki, 1924'te yapılan ahşap direkli camin yerine yakın zamanda betonarme olarak yeniden yapılan cami.",
    "en": "A mosque in the centre of Çiftliközü Town, Derbent; the wooden-posted mosque built in 1924 was replaced recently by a reinforced-concrete one."
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "tarihce",
      "order": 1,
      "title": {
        "tr": "Tarihçe ve mimari",
        "en": "History and architecture"
      },
      "body": {
        "tr": "Cumhuriyet'in ilk yıllarında, 1924'te yapılan cami ahşap direkli ve kırma çatılıydı. Minaresi 1961'de yapılmış, mihrap ve minberi 1976'da eklenmiştir. Son yıllarda tamamen yenilenerek yerine betonarme bir yapı inşa edilmiştir. Yeni cami derinlemesine dikdörtgen planlı ve kubbelidir; kuzeyde çokgen bir son cemaat yeri, kuzeydoğu köşede minare bulunur.",
        "en": "The mosque, built in 1924 in the first years of the Republic, had wooden posts and a hipped roof. Its minaret was built in 1961 and its mihrab and minbar added in 1976. In recent years it was fully renovated and a reinforced-concrete building built in its place. The new mosque is deeply rectangular and domed, with a polygonal narthex in the north and a minaret in the northeast corner."
      },
      "confidence": "certain",
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "source_id": "vk-konya-c1",
          "pages": "407"
        }
      ]
    }
